  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: 'This script will save the isOn state of Unity UI Toggles, position/rotation
    of Transforms, and IsActive state of GameObjects.


    NOTE: Notice the "Proxy
    Toggle" setup. If you have multiple toggles that do the same thing within your
    world, you should have the "sub/proxy" toggles set the main persistent toggle
    state, and the persistent toggle set the sub toggles WITHOUT NOTIFYING, so they
    don''t have an infinite loop.'
  url: 
  locked: 1
  type: 1
